# Student Management System in C++

This is a simple console-based Student Management System implemented in C++ using Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) concepts.

## Features
- Add new students
- Delete students
- Search for a student by ID
- Display all students
- Update student information
- Simple console menu for easy use

## Data Structures Used
- Classes and Objects (OOP)
- Arrays / Vectors (depending on your implementation)

## How to Run
1. Clone the repository or download the project files.
2. Compile all .cpp files (main.cpp + class files) using any C++ compiler.
3. Run `main.exe` or the compiled file.
4. Use the console menu to perform operations.

